# 🏗️ Final Phase 3 Architecture

Ab tumhara overall workflow roughly:

```text
                    ┌──────────────────┐
                    │     Webhook      │
                    └────────┬─────────┘
                             ↓
                    ┌──────────────────┐
                    │    Validation    │
                    └────────┬─────────┘
                             ↓
                    ┌──────────────────┐
                    │ Normalize Events │
                    └────────┬─────────┘
                             ↓
                    ┌──────────────────┐
                    │  Gemini AI       │
                    │  Triage Engine   │
                    └────────┬─────────┘
                             ↓
                    ┌──────────────────┐
                    │ Structured       │
                    │ Output Parser    │
                    └────────┬─────────┘
                             ↓
                    ┌──────────────────┐
                    │ Build Triage     │
                    │ Result           │
                    └────────┬─────────┘
                             ↓
                    ┌──────────────────┐
                    │ Validate AI      │
                    │ Triage           │
                    └───────┬──────────┘
                       TRUE │ FALSE
                            │    └──────────────→ Manual Review
                            ↓
                    ┌──────────────────┐
                    │ Validate Triage  │
                    │ Values           │
                    └────────┬─────────┘
                             ↓
                    ┌──────────────────┐
                    │ Severity Router  │
                    └────┬───┬───┬────┘
                         │   │   │
                    Critical High Medium Low
                       ↓     ↓     ↓    ↓
                    Escalate Prioritize Monitor Log
```

## 🎯 Phase 3 ka outcome

**Phase 3 successfully complete ✅**

OpsPilot ab sirf webhook se data receive nahi karta — ab woh **AI-powered decision making** karta hai:

> **Event → Understand → Classify → Validate → Prioritize → Decide Action**

Aur ye tumhare project ka important differentiator hai because tumne sirf "Gemini ko connect" nahi kiya; tumne **validation + structured output + routing + failure handling** bhi implement ki hai.

### Progress

```text
Phase 0 — Infrastructure       ✅
Phase 1 — Event Intake         ✅
Phase 2 — Validation           ✅
Phase 3 — AI Triage & Routing  ✅
Phase 4 — Persistence          ⏳
```

**Next: Phase 4 — Incident Persistence**, jahan hum PostgreSQL ko OpsPilot ki permanent memory banayenge.
